		{"id":"ppj-side-domain-review","type":"group","x":6640,"y":850,"width":760,"height":520,"color":"3","label":"DOMAIN / REGISTRATION REVIEW"},
		{"id":"executive-title","type":"text","text":"# PPJ SOFTWARE DELIVERY EXECUTIVE CONTROL\n\nTWO CONTROLLED STREAMS: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT + EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\n\nEach stream follows: BACKLOG -> KICK-OFF -> ANALYSIS -> DESIGN -> DEVELOPMENT -> UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE -> GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT -> CLOSED\n\nDrag a registered card between stream-stage groups and save. The enabled watcher validates and persists the change automatically.\n\nSnapshot: [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_PORTFOLIO_CURRENT_SNAPSHOT|Current Portfolio Snapshot]]","x":0,"y":-620,"width":7400,"height":250},
		{"id":"executive-reading-guide","type":"text","text":"## Control rules\n\nDelivery Stream and Delivery Stage are both resolved from card geometry. Lifecycle, Status, Progress, Current Gate, Priority and Primary Domain remain separate. ON HOLD / BLOCKED / WAITING are status overlays, never replacement stages. Candidate initiatives stay outside both streams until registered. CLOSED requires approved closure.","x":0,"y":-340,"width":7400,"height":180},
		{"id":"ppj-project-c542a373bdb1dbc0","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Active Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P2\nGate: Sew v1.2 and Wash Agent development\n\nOutcome\n- Generate a Costing / Quotation Package for Merchandising review and customer quotation.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":3350,"y":345,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-side-attention-note","type":"text","text":"## Status overlays\n\n- PPJxQSee.AI: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Reactivation decision\n- QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Business/customer case decision\n- PPJxStratova.AI: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Build-vs-buy evaluation\n- PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Working-session outcome unconfirmed\n- PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Academic problem package\n- PROD.COWASH.v2.0: External Collaboration | Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Owner/data/KPI/access/technical direction\n- PUR.HM.LabelO.Processing.Automation.v1.0: On Hold | Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT | Stage: ANALYSIS | Gate: Scalability decision\n\nThese are attention references, not duplicate project cards.","x":6670,"y":65,"width":700,"height":650},
		{"id":"ppj-side-domain-note","type":"text","text":"## Governance review\n\n- [[07_Decision_Log/DEC-20260824-ADMIN-EXPENSE-DOMAIN|Admin Expense domain decision]]\n- [[07_Decision_Log/DEC-20260824-WAREHOUSE-AWB-OCR-REGISTRATION|Warehouse AWB OCR registration/domain]]\n- [[07_Decision_Log/DEC-20260824-CPD-PATTERN-REGISTRATION|CPD Pattern registration]]\n\nThese notes do not create or duplicate canonical project cards.","x":6670,"y":915,"width":700,"height":390},
		{"id":"ppj-candidate-5db0266492159309","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_CANDIDATE_CARD:Warehouse AWB OCR -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/WAREHOUSE_AWB_OCR_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|Warehouse AWB OCR]]\n\nRegistration: Canonical Code Needed\nDomain: Needs Domain Governance Decision\nLifecycle: Active Enhancement\nGate: Canonical code and domain governance; Shipment Weight accuracy\n\nNot a pipeline project card until registration is approved.","x":6670,"y":1510,"width":700,"height":320},
		{"id":"ppj-candidate-25813e697a012870","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_CANDIDATE_CARD:CPD In-house Pattern Generation -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n\nRegistration: Canonical Code Not Confirmed\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nLifecycle: Internal Prototype / Evaluation\nGate: Build-vs-buy benchmark; canonical code pending\n\nNot a pipeline project card until registration is approved.","x":6670,"y":1870,"width":700,"height":320},
		{"id":"ppj-project-56ad3c7dd45eb61e","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DESIGN\nLifecycle: Active / WFX API Integration\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P3\nGate: WFX API contract discovery and controlled integration design\n\nOutcome\n- Automate GDI creation/update while preserving WFX transaction control, validation, confirmation and audit.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":2520,"y":345,"width":700,"height":310},
