		{"id":"ppj-project-bc75f5342844e3e8","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0]]\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nDelivery Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Business Case / Pre-PoC\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Decision\nGate: Business/customer case decision\n\nOutcome\n- Evaluate RFID thread only when QC need, MER commercial case, customer willingness to pay and factory feasibility align.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":6085,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-b228516f8b7a4d45","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PROD.COWASH.v2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|PROD.COWASH.v2.0]]\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nDelivery Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: On Hold\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Hold\nGate: Owner/data/KPI/access/technical direction\n\nOutcome\n- Preserve the operational wash execution/data initiative pending re-scope.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":5745,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-b09c2bcabc38e801","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PPJxStratova.AI -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI|PPJxStratova.AI]]\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nDelivery Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Strategic Technology Evaluation\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Decision\nGate: Build-vs-buy evaluation\n\nOutcome\n- Evaluate Stratova pattern technology against the internal pattern-generation benchmark.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":5405,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-0b0545a4c4de9930","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PPJxQSee.AI -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|PPJxQSee.AI]]\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nDelivery Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: On Hold\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Hold\nGate: Reactivation decision\n\nOutcome\n- Preserve the QC AI inspection opportunity until ownership, resources, data, metrics and budget exist.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":5065,"width":700,"height":310},
